  "summary": "Sally Beauty Holdings, Inc. operates as a specialty retailer and distributor of professional beauty supplies in the United States and internationally. The company operates through two segments, Sally Beauty and Beauty Systems Group. The Sally Beauty segment offers beauty products, including hair color and care products, nails, and styling tools to retail customers, salons, and salon professionals through domestic and international retail stores and digital platforms, including its website, a mobile commerce-based app, and third-party digital marketplaces. The Beauty Systems Group segment distributes professional beauty supplies to salons and licensed beauty professionals through company-operated stores, which are operating under the Cosmo Prof Banner name; franchised stores through its Armstrong McCall business; salon business consultants; and digital platforms, including its website, a mobile commerce-based app, and chain portals. Sally Beauty Holdings, Inc. was founded in 1964 and is headquartered in Plano, Texas.",
